WEBVTT

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.120
What?!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.580
This is so troublesome.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.120
Stop it...

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.750
Maybe I should just kill all of you now.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.370
Stop! Souma!

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:33.950
More importantly...

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.250
Why are you still alive?!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.370
I see.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:56.580
Long time no see, Akira.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:27.950
"AFTERLOST"

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:34.000
"Episode 6: Parting Ways"

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.950
Tama-shi?

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.000
There's no time to explain.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.040
Are you going to fight me?

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.950
Open your eyes, Souma!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.790
You're the one daydreaming.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:18.500
As I thought, you don't get it at all, Sis.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:25.410
For some reason, you're annoying.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.540
If you can't do anything, stay down!

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:36.200
You're in the way.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.580
Well, let's finish this.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:03:59.950
I told you, it's no use.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:05.120
If only he didn't have that Artifact...

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:11.540
We were both caught up
in the Lost, but we survived.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.790
We're special.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:17.450
We're different from you,
who couldn't even protect yourself.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:24.750
Are you okay? Let me see.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:34.250
Sorry, I can't completely erase your wound.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.000
The same power as Leader?

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:45.000
Could it be that you're the leader's...

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.540
Where is my brother?

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:50.620
He will definitely return.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:54.000
Leader will definitely return.

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:15.620
I'll take my time with you guys later.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:32.950
She did it!

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.080
Just kidding.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.540
Since it looks like you all don't really know...

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:45.040
...let me show you something interesting.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.830
Tsuki's Tears!

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.540
Brother?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:12.000
--Leader!
--Leader?!

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:17.080
Shit!

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.370
Tsubasa?!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.830
Akira...

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.250
Huh?!

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:50.500
Takuya...

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:57.410
Akira!

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.450
What a shitty reunion...

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:07.660
But something's wrong!

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.620
That isn't our leader!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:21.620
Goddamn! There's the last of my severance pay.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.830
Ten years at the factory and
they only gave you thirty thousand yen.

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:28.410
They're looking down on you, Kankichi.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:32.370
I don't want to hear that from
a guy who lives in net cafés.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:34.410
Hurry up and find a job.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:36.200
I looked.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:42.540
Only shitty jobs are available
for outcasts like us.

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:47.910
Hey, should we do it for real?

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:50.910
Huh?

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:53.620
Shit! What the hell?!

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:57.120
Are you cheating? Hey?!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.620
Give me back my money, idiot!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.870
Huh?! Don't joke with me! Shit!

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:09.000
You're really noisy, old man.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.410
Huh?

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:12.750
It's not good to shift the blame.

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:15.040
Leave your wallet and get out.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.330
Huh?

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:23.910
Y-You can't scare adults
with toys like that! Hey!

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:24.950
Huh?

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:28.750
Huh?! Got a problem kid? Hey!

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:31.750
Why don't you try getting
a proper hard-working job!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:37.000
Huh? Say something! Hey!
It's because of trash like you--

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.250
What?

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.040
It's a toy.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.540
What's he screaming about?

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.580
How stupid.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.120
Hey, let's go.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.750
Huh? Huh?!

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:12.290
Hey.

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:14.000
Hold on a second.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:18.160
Oh, it's you guys.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.620
What was that just now?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.080
Who the hell are you?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.370
Something similar to you guys.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:32.370
Oh, that's right. You guys are free, right?

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:36.830
Then, wanna do something bigger?

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:41.830
Leader...

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.330
Shit!

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.580
What did you do to our leader?

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.500
Answer me!

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.620
You just don't learn.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:04.620
Now, hurry up. Finish him, Tsubasa.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.500
Sumire!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.790
That guy...

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.290
Akira!

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.950
Miss Yuki. Your will...

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:58.080
Please... strongly maintain your will.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:05.620
I can't...

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:08.370
I told you before.

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:13.500
You can't protect anyone, Akira.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:20.580
Stop it already!

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:21.790
Stop it!

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:24.330
Miss Yuki...

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.370
That's enough already.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:38.910
What's wrong, Little Brother?

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:41.750
What did you do to my brother?!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:48.040
Well, Big Brother.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.540
Kill your little brother.

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:56.700
Brother...

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.410
He's missing on purpose?

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.830
Brother...

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.080
What are you doing?!

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:20.120
Hit him properly!

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.160
Give it back!

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:39.000
Brother...

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:43.450
Jeez. I guess it can't be helped.
Did you trip over this?

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:48.790
Don't cry. Here. Look.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.790
Wow! It disappeared!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.080
Along with your tears!

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:08.330
Brother, you want me to erase this?

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:15.950
Where are you?! Give it back! That's mine!

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:27.040
Stop it!

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.410
Yuki!

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:04.450
Brother...

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:10.450
Tsubasa's Tama-shi is still here.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:17.660
I think their affection for
each other is keeping him here.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:20.500
"Light of Hope Academy for Disabled Children"

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.250
"Light of Hope Academy for Disabled Children"
Light of Hope, it says.

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:29.790
It'd be great if it's there. Hope.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:38.870
I heard we're getting plastic models today!

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:39.540
Amazing!

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:40.750
All right!

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.950
He has potential.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:01.080
But number 57 has a lot more potential.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.290
The little brother...

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:08.620
Hey, number 24! What are you doing?!

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:13.660
Let go!

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.200
It disappeared?

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.910
What does this mean?!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.370
What happened?

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:27.950
The Artifact disappeared.

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:36.290
Oh? It is not the power we are looking for,
but it seems to be a useful one.

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:48.830
I should be enough for them.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:56.750
Yoshiaki, I will erase all the Artifacts
in this world before your power awakens.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:02.790
If I do that, you'll be free.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:14.000
It's fine for you to rest
every once in a while like this.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:18.200
Sorry. I caused you all trouble.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.660
But, how did you guys...?

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:23.910
Hm?

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:25.370
What is it?

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:30.120
This is a fake...

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:32.160
Huh?!

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:35.370
That means they knew we were after it!

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:37.950
No way...

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:44.250
Well, this is still a pretty nice item!

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:52.000
See? I was thinking this chandelier
was missing something.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:08.580
"Huh? Looks like my account was hacked
before I realized it. I've recovered it now.
Sorry for making you all worry."

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:20.700
Where are you? Taiyo!

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:24.660
Give Yoshiaki back! Yoshiaki!

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:31.290
Yoshiaki...

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.120
Thank you, Brother.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:56.410
I never knew...

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:12.080
Leader.

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:14.500
Let's meet again.

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.700
Jack, that...

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.870
He still had that?

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:29.410
Not funny at all.

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:34.790
Hey, hey. Kiddo. You awake?

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.000
I'll cut him up.

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.410
Wait!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:42.410
Come back, Souma.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:51.200
You haven't changed.
You always think you're right, Sis.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:55.620
I've always hated that part of you!

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:04.000
You always looked like you were
shouldering everything all by yourself.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:18.790
What do you know, Sis? Am I just a
heavy weight on your shoulders?

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:21.250
Don't treat me like a kid!

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.660
You're the one who should come with me.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:30.790
I'll save you. I'll be the
one to save you, Sis...

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:39.750
I'm sorry.

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:42.700
I'm sorry, Souma.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:47.410
I didn't understand anything about you.

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:57.000
That's why I told you.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:03.700
Not only did Souma's plan fail,
our enemies have him now.

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:08.660
Suzuna, with your powers, you should
have been able to see this coming.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.290
Why didn't you say anything?

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.830
Wasn't this the result you wished for?

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:27.660
I have no idea when he
will regain consciousness.

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:33.000
But his body will recover
as long as he rests here.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:38.290
We have to do something before
the Agency tries to take him back.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:46.950
Sorry for making you wait.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:49.160
Not at all.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:50.370
This way.

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:52.160
Um...

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:56.700
Are you really going? If he wakes up...

00:20:56.700 --> 00:21:00.500
That's why we're going before
he regains consciousness.

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.660
I want to do what I can.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:07.120
I need solid proof of his
relationship with them.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:09.000
Will you come with me?

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:14.410
Hey. You must be Takuya.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:19.200
So these were the guys watching me?

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:23.700
You're sharp. But we aren't your enemy.

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:28.580
We'd like to go with you to the
Light of Hope Academy for Disabled Children.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:33.330
Our friend was murdered.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:37.580
We're not after you guys.

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:44.080
That's how it is.

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:46.830
Miss Yumiko.

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:50.500
Oh, did I wake you?

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:52.120
Where is Takuya?

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:57.080
He went out pretty far today.

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:00.910
"Light of Hope Academy for Disabled Children"

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:06.450
"Light of Hope Academy for Disabled Children"
Looks like it's time for him to face his past.

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:46.160
Next Episode: "Regret."
